        "l": 162.00363,
        "t": 568.3131699999999,
        "r": 425.1736300000001,
        "b": 557.07317
      },
      "content": "Coat all the internal surfaces of  the bearing frame (228) with oil."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1584",
      "reading_order": 1835,
      "section": "CAUTION:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 162.00365,
        "t": 555.13113,
        "r": 386.70365,
        "b": 529.37113
      },
      "content": "Install the shaft assembly into the bearing frame (228). Make sure that the shaft rotates freely."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1585",
      "reading_order": 1836,
      "section": "CAUTION:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 162.00369,
        "t": 527.42909,
        "r": 483.7336900000003,
        "b": 516.18909
      },
      "content": "Install the clamp bolts (370C) in the bearing housing (134) and tighten by hand."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1586",
      "reading_order": 1837,
      "section": "CAUTION:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 162.00367,
        "t": 514.24705,
        "r": 544.5236700000005,
        "b": 491.00704999999994
      },
      "content": "Install the jack bolts (370D) with the locknuts (423) in the bearing housing (134) and tighten by hand."
    },
    {
